-- 23_more_asana_templates.sql
-- Four more project templates, rebuilt from the Asana projects DSD copies
-- (checked 24 Nov 2026): Content Orbit (Marketing; from the latest copy of
-- Marita's Asana template) and Planning Center's product checklists
-- (Product Launching, Product Update, Product Deactivation; from the 2025
-- product projects). Asana milestones become ordinary tasks; Asana approval
-- subtasks say they are approvals. Each task starts with "Usually done by:
-- <Asana name>"; the end of this file assigns them to people who already
-- have an Atlas account (same as 19, with three more names).
-- Needs 16_templates.sql. Safe to run more than once.

begin;

